<title>FINLAND: KESLA 1996 PROFIT DIVES 80 PCT.</title>
<headline>KESLA 1996 PROFIT DIVES 80 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    1.94 vs 9.37</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.36 vs 20.95</p>
<p> Net sales					  70.81 vs 102.52</p>
<p> Operating profit				  3.08 vs 11.70</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 1.94 vs 9.37</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.60 vs 7.76</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		56 vs 50</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish forestry harvester manufacturer is</p>
<p>Kesla Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
